          "desc": "A character with this disadvantage tends to go berserk during periods of stress or in canbat. Berserk characters do not know friend fran foe, and autanatically attack whoever is in front of them, until the target is knocked out or killed (whichever canes first). The Berserk character will then attack the nearest moving character in his sight. Berserk characters will use their most effective offensive power at full damage while Berserk.",
